      "content": "these are decent, i guess. but honestly, looking at the score tracker, the coverage is pretty low. it's only hitting like 0 or 1 of those terms. i need the questions to be more explicitly aligned with the specific language we use at Lumina so that even if the candidate gives a vague answer, we can see if they're at least attempting to speak our \"language\". \n\ncan you rewrite these 5 questions? try to weave in those specific terms (innovative, teamwork, synergy, growth-mindset, collaboration) more naturally so the score is higher, but please—try to keep them from sounding like a robot wrote them. i really need the questions to remain useful for high-level hiring.",
